{"title":"Career Roadmap · Compliance Analyst","role":"Compliance Analyst","summary":"A Compliance Analyst helps banks, insurance companies, financial institutions, FinTech companies, and other regulated organizations comply with applicable laws, regulations, internal policies, and regulatory expectations.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Banking & Insurance Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Compliance Analyst helps banks, insurance companies, financial institutions, FinTech companies, and other regulated organizations comply with applicable laws, regulations, internal policies, and regulatory expectations."},{"type":"p","text":"For a student specializing in Banking & Insurance Law, this career combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Financial Services","Regulatory Compliance","Risk Management","Data Analysis"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory research"},{"text":"Compliance monitoring"},{"text":"Policy review"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"KYC/AML compliance support"},{"text":"Regulatory reporting"},{"text":"Internal compliance testing"},{"text":"Customer-protection compliance"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring support"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Audit support"},{"text":"Compliance issue tracking"},{"text":"Regulatory-change monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A law graduate can be particularly valuable because they can understand the legal basis behind regulatory requirements, rather than treating compliance as only a checklist exercise."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Integrated LL.B.","Banking & Insurance Law","Banking / Insurance / Compliance Internship","Compliance Intern / Legal Compliance Intern","Junior Compliance Analyst","Compliance Analyst","Senior 