Risk Assessment","Remediation Plan","Implementation","Testing","Evidence","Management Reporting"]}]},{"heading":"Regulatory Change Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Financial regulations change frequently."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to maintain a regulatory tracker:"},{"type":"table","header":["Regulation / Requirement","Business Area","Effective Date","Impact","Action","Owner","Status"],"rows":[]},{"type":"p","text":"The process should be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regulatory Update","Read Primary Source","Understand Requirement","Identify Impact","Assign Responsible Team","Update Policy / Control","Implement","Test","Document"]},{"type":"p","text":"For India-focused careers, students should learn to work directly with current primary regulatory sources and notifications, rather than relying only on old coaching material."}]},{"heading":"KYC & Customer Due Diligence","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"KYC is an important entry-level area in financial-services compliance."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer identification"},{"text":"Identity verification"},{"text":"Customer risk classification"},{"text":"Beneficial ownership"},{"text":"Customer due diligence"},{"text":"Enhanced due diligence"},{"text":"Ongoing monitoring"},{"text":"Periodic review"},{"text":"Record keeping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer Onboarding","Identity Verification","Customer Information","Risk Assessment","Beneficial Ownership","Screening","Approval","Ongoing Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact process depends on the institution, product, customer type, and applicable requirements."}]},{"heading":"AML & Financial Crime","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Money laundering"},{"text":"Terrorist-financing risk"},{"text":"Fraud"},{"text":"Suspicious transactions"},{"text":"Customer risk"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"},{"text":"Sanctions screening"},{"text":"Beneficial ownership"},{"text":"Source-of-funds considerations"},{"text":"Escalation processes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AML workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer","KYC","Risk Classification","Transaction Monitoring","Alert","Investigation","Risk Assessment","Escalation","Appropriate Regulatory / Internal Action"]},{"type":"p","text":"A law background is useful because AML work requires careful interpretation of legal and regulatory obligations."}]},{"heading":"Banking Compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand compliance issues surrounding:"},{"type":"h","text":"Deposits"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer protection"},{"text":"Account opening"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Data handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Lending"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Loan documentation"},{"text":"Customer disclosures"},{"text":"Fair practices"},{"text":"Security"},{"text":"Recovery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Payments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital payments"},{"text":"Payment intermediaries"},{"text":"Fraud prevention"},{"text":"Customer authentication"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Banking"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Online onboarding"},{"text":"Digital KYC"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Data privacy"},{"text":"Electronic records"},{"text":"Customer complaints"}]}]},{"heading":"Insurance Compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A compliance analyst in insurance should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy documentation"},{"text":"Product approval"},{"text":"Customer disclosures"},{"text":"Claims"},{"text":"Underwriting"},{"text":"Insurance intermediaries"},{"text":"Agent/broker compliance"},{"text":"Customer grievances"},{"text":"Fraud"},{"text":"Data protection"},{"text":"Regulatory reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance lifecycle"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product Design","Regulatory Review",