xt":"What corrective action is required?"}]}]},{"heading":"Financial Contracts","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Banking & Insurance Law student should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Banking"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Loan agreements"},{"text":"Security documents"},{"text":"Guarantees"},{"text":"Mortgage-related documents"},{"text":"Payment agreements"},{"text":"Vendor contracts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Insurance policies"},{"text":"Agency agreements"},{"text":"Broker agreements"},{"text":"Distribution agreements"},{"text":"Reinsurance agreements"},{"text":"Service-provider agreements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important clauses"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Obligations"},{"text":"Representations"},{"text":"Warranties"},{"text":"Liability"},{"text":"Indemnity"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Data protection"},{"text":"Termination"},{"text":"Dispute resolution"}]}]},{"heading":"Consumer Protection","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Financial institutions directly affect consumers."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer disclosures"},{"text":"Mis-selling"},{"text":"Unfair practices"},{"text":"Complaints"},{"text":"Grievances"},{"text":"Fees and charges"},{"text":"Product suitability"},{"text":"Transparency"},{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Customer communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong compliance professional should ask:"},{"type":"p","text":"Is the organization technically compliant while still creating an unreasonable customer risk?"}]},{"heading":"FinTech Compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"FinTech creates a major career opportunity."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital lending"},{"text":"Digital payments"},{"text":"Wallets"},{"text":"Payment gateways"},{"text":"Embedded finance"},{"text":"Online insurance"},{"text":"InsurTech"},{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"Digital identity"},{"text":"AI-based credit scoring"},{"text":"Open banking concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"FinTech compliance model"},{"type":"p","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Financial Product"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Customer Data"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Regulation"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Cybersecurity"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Consumer Protection","FinTech Compliance"]}]},{"heading":"RegTech","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how technology is used to improve compliance."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automated KYC"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"},{"text":"Sanctions screening"},{"text":"Regulatory reporting"},{"text":"Compliance dashboards"},{"text":"Risk scoring"},{"text":"Regulatory-change monitoring"},{"text":"Document automation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A future-ready Compliance Analyst should understand both:"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulation + Compliance Technology"}]},{"heading":"Data & Analytics Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Compliance increasingly involves large datasets."},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Duplicate identification"},{"text":"Basic statistical analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Basic SQL can help analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"Customer records"},{"text":"Compliance exceptions"},{"text":"KYC data"},{"text":"Alerts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"SELECT customer_id, risk_level"},{"type":"p","text":"FROM customers"},{"type":"p","text":"WHERE risk_level = 'HIGH';"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance dashboards"},{"text":"KYC status"},{"text":"AML alerts"},{"text":"Regulatory issues"},{"text":"Audit findings"},{"text":"Remediation tracking"}]}]},{"heading":"Tools & Software","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with categories of:"},{"type":"h","text":"GRC"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Control management"},{"text":"Issue management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Case Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance cases"},{"text":"Investigations"},{"text":"Alerts"},{"text":"Escalations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KYC platforms"},{"text":"AML systems"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"},{"text":"Sanctions screening"},{"text":"Regulatory reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Productivity"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Word"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Teams/Slack-type collaboration tools"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You do not need expertise in every enterprise platform. Understanding the workflow and purpose of these systems is more important initially."}]},{"heading":"AI in Compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI is increasingly useful for compliance operations."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory document summarization"},{"text":"Regulatory-change monitoring"},{"text":"Policy comparison"},{"text":"Compliance issue classification"},{"text":"Transaction-anomaly detection"},{"text":"Document review"},{"text":"KYC document extraction"},{"text":"Risk scoring support"},{"text":"Compliance reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Responsible workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI Detection / Assistance","Human Review","Legal & Regulatory Verification","Risk Assessment","Compliance Decision","Documentation"]},{"type":"p","text":"AI should assist compliance professionals, not replace human judgment in high-risk re