,"text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking compliance"},{"text":"Insurance compliance"},{"text":"AML"},{"text":"KYC"},{"text":"Financial crime"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Governance, Risk & Compliance"},{"text":"Cybersecurity fundamentals"},{"text":"Data protection"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Regulatory technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a law student, certifications should complement the LL.B., not replace practical internships and regulatory research ability."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"LL.M."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible specializations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking & Finance Law"},{"text":"Corporate Law"},{"text":"Commercial Law"},{"text":"Financial Regulation"},{"text":"Insurance Law"},{"text":"Business Law"},{"text":"Tax Law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other options"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on career goals:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"Risk Management"},{"text":"Financial Management"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Financial Crime / AML"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For management-level compliance roles, combining legal knowledge with finance, risk and business understanding can be particularly valuable."}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Compliance Analyst can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Banking Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Banking products, customer operations and regulatory requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"AML/KYC"},{"type":"p","text":"Financial crime prevention and customer due diligence."},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Insurance products, distribution and claims."},{"type":"h","text":"FinTech Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Technology-enabled financial services."},{"type":"h","text":"Payments Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Payment systems and transaction-related requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Regulatory interpretation and implementation."},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Testing whether controls operate effectively."},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Reporting"},{"type":"p","text":"Preparing and validating regulatory submissions."},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer Protection"},{"type":"p","text":"Customer treatment, disclosures and grievance management."},{"type":"h","text":"Privacy Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Financial data and personal-data protection."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Compliance Intern","Junior Compliance Analyst","Compliance Analyst","Senior Compliance Analyst","Compliance Specialist","Compliance Manager","Senior Compliance Manager","Head of Compliance","Chief Compliance Officer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Specialist route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Compliance Analyst","AML/KYC Specialist","Financial Crime Compliance Manager","Financial Crime Compliance Head"]},{"type":"p","text":"Regulatory route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Compliance Analyst","Regulatory Compliance Specialist","Regulatory Affairs Manager","Regulatory Strategy / Compliance Leadership"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies to Track","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A future-ready financial-services Compliance Analyst should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"AI-based fraud detection"},{"text":"AI credit scoring"},{"text":"Automated KYC"},{"text":"Biometrics"},{"text":"Digital identity"},{"text":"Blockchain"},{"text":"Smart contracts"},{"text":"Digital assets"},{"text":"Open banking"},{"text":"Embedded finance"},{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"Cloud banking"},{"text":"API banking"},{"text":"Real-time payments"},{"text":"Privacy-enhancing technologies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The key question is:"},{"type":"p","text":"What regulatory, legal, operational, consumer and financial-crime risks does this technology 